{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BARREN</strong> is an immersive sim roguelike with survival components.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the tools that you have and survive in this mysterious harsh desolated place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337440/extras/d29c9ec31c9393090dafa218aad688bf.poster.avif?t=1763638753\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337440/extras/d29c9ec31c9393090dafa218aad688bf.webm?t=1763638753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337440/extras/d29c9ec31c9393090dafa218aad688bf.mp4?t=1763638753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Vehicle Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your vehicle is your lifeline between zones. Keep it running, solve problems. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fully Procedural Weapon Animation System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a different kind of weapon handling, powered by a fully custom procedural animation system.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337440/extras/f332024eb9177e7623406e2332587eb9.poster.avif?t=1763638753\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337440/extras/f332024eb9177e7623406e2332587eb9.webm?t=1763638753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337440/extras/f332024eb9177e7623406e2332587eb9.mp4?t=1763638753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Demanding Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies in BARREN are precise, unforgiving, and lethal. Every encounter tests your awareness, accuracy, and understanding of your surroundings.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sandbox / Systemic Interaction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive in BARREN, you must learn how its world works. Reroute power, repair failing systems, and manipulate machines to open paths or gain an edge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Variations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run changes the rules.<br>Your vehicle\u2019s systems, the layout of zones, and the resources you find are all different each time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3337440?t=1763638753","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3337440?t=1763638753","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337440/57e579c3b1dc9e8db7576faa69037bda0b970640/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763638753","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337440/57e579c3b1dc9e8db7576faa69037bda0b970640/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763638753","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BARREN</strong> is an immersive sim roguelike with survival components.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the tools that you have and survive in this mysterious harsh desolated place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337440/extras/d29c9ec31c9393090dafa218aad688bf.poster.avif?t=1763638753\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337440/extras/d29c9ec31c9393090dafa218aad688bf.webm?t=1763638753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337440/extras/d29c9ec31c9393090dafa218aad688bf.mp4?t=1763638753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Vehicle Survival</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your vehicle is your lifeline between zones. Keep it running, solve problems. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fully Procedural Weapon Animation System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a different kind of weapon handling, powered by a fully custom procedural animation system.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337440/extras/f332024eb9177e7623406e2332587eb9.poster.avif?t=1763638753\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337440/extras/f332024eb9177e7623406e2332587eb9.webm?t=1763638753\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337440/extras/f332024eb9177e7623406e2332587eb9.mp4?t=1763638753\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Demanding Enemies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies in BARREN are precise, unforgiving, and lethal. Every encounter tests your awareness, accuracy, and understanding of your surroundings.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Sandbox / Systemic Interaction</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive in BARREN, you must learn how its world works. Reroute power, repair failing systems, and manipulate machines to open paths or gain an edge.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Endless Variations</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run changes the rules.<br>Your vehicle\u2019s systems, the layout of zones, and the resources you find are all different each time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Veilleur Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3337440/d3b7c204c4a4568c9f11d19ea7a19daa46995ec7/header.jpg?t=1763638753","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"BARREN","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong>  Windows 7 SP1+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core+ with SSE2 instruction set support<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong>  DX10 (shader model 4.0) support, VRAM 2+ GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 10<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Veilleur Stud